{"id":"049c0e933557b214","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-weakly-normalizing.md","title":"弱正规化","display":"df-weakly-normalizing — 弱正规化","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-weakly-normalizing","aliases":["56-df-weakly-normalizing"],"display":"df-weakly-normalizing — 弱正规化","depends_on":["[[56-df-has-normal-form]]","[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]"],"source_section":"§1.1 Definition 1.1.13(ii)","source_printed_pages":"13","source_ocr_blocks":[34],"source_verification":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-weakly-normalizing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-weakly-normalizing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weakly-normalizing — 弱正规化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb8ed99b81b3baa9\" href=\"?note=bb8ed99b81b3baa9\" title=\"56-df-has-normal-form\">56-df-has-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.1 Definition 1.1.13(ii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"13"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>34</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span>；单关系抽象归约系统见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bb8ed99b81b3baa9\" href=\"?note=bb8ed99b81b3baa9\" title=\"56-df-has-normal-form\">56-df-has-normal-form</a>；元素参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 在断言内有界量化，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\varnothing\">\\(A=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{WNAt}(A,\\to,a)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{HasNF}(A,\\to,a)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{WNAt}(A,\\to,a)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{HasNF}(A,\\to,a)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WN}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{WNAt}(A,\\to,a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WN}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{WNAt}(A,\\to,a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>WNAt是项级性质，WN是关系级性质；二者用不同名字避免元数漂移。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-has-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"bb8ed99b81b3baa9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-has-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\to\\subseteq A\\times A$；单关系抽象归约系统见 [[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-has-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"bb8ed99b81b3baa9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HasNF}$ 见 [[56-df-has-normal-form]]；元素参数 $a$ 在断言内有界量化，允许 $A=\\varnothing$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\to\\subseteq A\\times A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasNF}","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{WNAt}(A,\\to,a)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{HasNF}(A,\\to,a)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WN}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{WNAt}(A,\\to,a).","display":true}],"bytes":1245,"backlinks":[{"id":"9e7e983eeefce662","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WNAt}$ 见 [[56-df-weakly-normalizing]]；$\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}$ 及 $\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-normalizing-strategy]]。"},{"id":"6a238253009869a2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F\\in A^A$，$\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}$ 和迭代见 [[56-df-reduction-strategy]]，$\\mathrm{WNAt}$ 见 [[56-df-weakly-normalizing]]。"},{"id":"da36188240be185b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定普通项重写系统 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),R$。$\\mathcal E_R,\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\ell,\\operatorname{step}_i,\\operatorname{InfRed}_R$ 见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]；$\\to_R$ 为其所用的一步关系。$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]，$\\mathrm{WNAt}$ 见 [[56-df-weakly-normalizing]]。各策略谓词以 $S\\subseteq\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 为参数。$\\operatorname{FinStrategy}_R$ 的局部路径参数为 $\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$；$\\operatorname{InfStrategy}_R$ 的局部序列参数为 $\\boldsymbol s\\in T^{\\mathbb N}$、$\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}$；正规化策略定义中的序列由其内部量词绑定。"},{"id":"24ab7835d52d9508","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"UN、WN见 [[56-df-unique-normal-form]]、[[56-df-weakly-normalizing]]。"},{"id":"af80c4c087c85f9a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-weakly-normalizing.md]]"},{"id":"3374832c41169108","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-disjoint-union]] 的 $\\Sigma_i,R_i,V,T_i,\\to_i$ 及并系统 $\\Sigma,R,T,\\to$；两个函数符号集不交，原分量和混合项的关系分别在各自签名中计算。 $\\mathrm{WN}$ 见 [[56-df-weakly-normalizing]]，层数见 [[56-df-modular-term-rank]]。"},{"id":"2242dbd4d93961ea","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"工作于ZFC。强、弱正规化见 [[56-df-strongly-normalizing]]、[[56-df-weakly-normalizing]]。"},{"id":"f4c4c74c238d39f8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"WN、UN、合流见 [[56-df-weakly-normalizing]]、[[56-df-unique-normal-form]]、[[56-df-confluent]]；合流蕴含UN见 [[56-thm-confluent-implies-unique-normal-form]]。"}],"outgoing":["bb8ed99b81b3baa9","89129816153530db"]}